ndly attitude is more problematic for crew cooperation. So we can shift vote to B.\n\nThus we will produce a public message: \"I appreciate the points about A, but I have concerns about his unfriendly demeanor, which could impair crew cooperation, whereas B shows strong reliability and stress handling, making him a better overall fit.\" Provide explicit facts.\n\nWe must include metadata vote: Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
